From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] board: canaan: k230_nano3s: add avalon nano3s board support

Add the Avalon Nano3s, a K230 board that boots from SPI-NAND. Bank
IO0_IO1 and IO14_IO25 run at 1.8 V and the others at 3.3 V. The device
tree describes the PWM buzzer (IO7) and fan (IO8), I2C2 (IO11-12), QSPI0
(IO14-19), the WS2812 LED (IO35) and the LCD (IO38-40). The board code
selects the A/B boot slots and the root file system, sets the fan speed,
drives the WS2812 status LED over I2S and draws the boot logo on the
ST7789V LCD.

Upstream-Status: Pending
